["What does it cost to recharge a home battery in Pennsylvania?", "About $2.83 to refill 13 kWh from the grid at Pennsylvania's August 2026 average residential price of 21.77 cents per kWh (EIA). 13 × $0.2177 = $2.83, before charging losses."]
